"title": "拉海‧萊 （Lahai-Roi）",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "拉海萊 LahaiRoi",
"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<h1>拉海‧萊（Lahai-Roi）</h1><p>這是某英文譯本對庇耳‧拉海‧萊（Beer-lahai-roi）的拼寫形式。這個名稱指的是一口井，記載於<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen24:62\">創世記二十四章62節</a>和<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen25:11\">二十五章11節</a>。</p><p><em>見 </em><span data-bnType=\"resourceReference\" data-resourceId=\"3236\" data-resourceType=\"TyndaleBibleDictionary\">庇耳‧拉海‧萊</span>。</p>",
